3021: Assigned gate coverage & Definition~\ref{def:record-gate-soundness-external-interface}, Proposition~\ref{prop:record-gate-soundness-external-interface-exactness}, and Theorem~\ref{thm:assigned-gate-soundness-audit-boundary} & gate implementation soundness is not inferred from a pass-row pointer \\
3022: Source-interface import & Lemma~\ref{lem:source-interface-extraction-correctness} and Propositions~\ref{prop:reviewable-source-snapshot-interface}, \ref{prop:source-interface-record-file-consistency}, and~\ref{prop:source-interface-evidence-level-separation} & bounded line-range paraphrases do not import exact BEDC/Lean theorem statements or fresh rebuilds \\
